      "duration_seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "text": "And this shift is not going to happen",
      "start_seconds": 742.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36
    },
    {
      "text": "alone. It's happening in parallel with",
      "start_seconds": 743.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "text": "AI, one of the most transformative",
      "start_seconds": 745.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "text": "technologies of our lifetimes. If AI is",
      "start_seconds": 747.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "rewriting how companies are built, then",
      "start_seconds": 750.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.079
    },
    {
      "text": "internet capital markets are rewriting",
      "start_seconds": 752.399,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68
    },
    {
      "text": "how companies are going to be financed,",
      "start_seconds": 754.079,
      "duration_seconds": 1.601
    },
    {
      "text": "traded, and owned.",
      "start_seconds": 755.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": "It's an incredibly exciting time to be",
      "start_seconds": 758.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "text": "an investor and a builder in the space.",
      "start_seconds": 760.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.079
    },
    {
      "text": "This is truly a generational opportunity",
      "start_seconds": 762.639,
      "duration_seconds": 2.561
    },
    {
      "text": "um that only presents itself when the",
      "start_seconds": 765.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.439
    },
    {
      "text": "conditions are just right. We finally",
      "start_seconds": 766.639,
      "duration_seconds": 2.161
    },
    {
      "text": "have the alignment on both the",
      "start_seconds": 768.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.279
    },
    {
      "text": "technology side and the regulatory side",
      "start_seconds": 770.079,
      "duration_seconds": 2.161
    },
    {
      "text": "to get there. When we look back in 20",
      "start_seconds": 772.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "text": "years, the year 2025 is going to be",
      "start_seconds": 774.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "text": "remembered as the year that the dam",
      "start_seconds": 776.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28
    },
    {
      "text": "broke. It's going to be akin to how the",
      "start_seconds": 777.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Telecommunications Act of 1996 unleashed",
      "start_seconds": 780.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "the power of the internet.",
      "start_seconds": 782.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.479
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone here, all of the builders and",
      "start_seconds": 785.279,
      "duration_seconds": 2.081
    },
    {
      "text": "entrepreneurs in the room and all the",
      "start_seconds": 787.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36
    },
    {
      "text": "investors here along with everyone who's",
      "start_seconds": 788.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.919
    },
    {
      "text": "watching at home online has a chance not",
      "start_seconds": 790.639,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "just to witness this shift, but to be an",
      "start_seconds": 793.279,
      "duration_seconds": 2.081
    },
    {
      "text": "active participant in it because",
      "start_seconds": 795.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36
    },
    {
      "text": "internet capital markets are open to",
      "start_seconds": 796.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44
    },
    {
      "text": "everybody. Thank you.",
      "start_seconds": 798.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5
